"\"\<left\>\"", Cell[TextData[{
     "WaterFatShiftDirection is an options for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "f4567489-1a69-da4c-add9-5ab7a909eead"],
     ". It specifies the water fat shift direction: \"left\", \"right\", \"up\
\" and \"down\"."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2b19562d-f849-eb4e-a440-ac54734de9f2"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "2036c292-6c0c-6848-9695-1fcebea02ff0"], 
    ButtonBox["EPGFatShift",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGFatShift"], "0.", Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["EPGFatShift",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGFatShift"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"396c0901-5488-3d42-9420-3c6c554d8535"],
     " is an options for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "9eabf9c0-6dc7-3f4a-aa00-d44ad0d1a04b"],
     ". Specifies the amount of shift of the fat refocusing pulse relative to \
the fat exitation pulse in slice profile samples, the sign does not matter.\n\
Can be obtained form ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["GetPulseProfile",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/GetPulseProfile"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"48cbdc9d-6c4d-1c42-be6a-23bf21aed886"],
     " with FatFieldStrength."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"fb4741c0-e628-fc49-95c5-75d02fed01f1"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "47a3f5fc-ba4f-3e40-8aea-f7261e9b1bfc"], 
    ButtonBox["DictT2IncludeWater",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DictT2IncludeWater"], 
    ButtonBox["False",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["DictT2IncludeWater",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DictT2IncludeWater"]], 
      "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"77ed5ef4-d73c-9e4a-829d-27b25049b846"],
     " is an options for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "cc39526a-03ec-9b45-82c3-9055ac11be84"],
     " and ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["CreateT2Dictionary",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/CreateT2Dictionary"]], 
      "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3435353d-e88c-c746-8f06-89611667c197"],
     ". If ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["True",
       BaseStyle->"Link"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "ddac973d-b6f5-364f-8d4b-782c47ae48b6"],
     " the fat signal is modeled as adipose tissue with 90% lipid and 10% \
water with a t2 of 20 ms.\nThe water and fat outputs of ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "6d85f4f7-ff5c-4145-8286-7e6faa760de8"],
     " are then the water and lipid signals and the fat fraction is the lipid \
fraction, as reported by Dixon.\nBased on Keene KR et.al. DOI: \
10.1002/mrm.28290."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6934b9e9-18e3-4947-be2d-f4ece10129c7"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "10d137eb-8631-cc41-b9f1-0b4f829da9f9"], 
    ButtonBox["EPGMethodCal",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGMethodCal"], "\"\<2compF\>\"", Cell[
    TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["EPGMethodCal",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGMethodCal"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"fc36a192-5a35-3c40-88f6-0af601058f7c"],
     " is an option for Calibrate",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "36dd9f17-715e-6c4b-831c-3dfea2900e68"],
     " and ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "b20dad44-503d-9840-961a-b50ec46a9ffc"],
     ". The calibration can be done using \"1comp\", \"2comp\", \"2compF\".\n\
\"1comp\" assumes pure fat, \"2comp\" assumes 90% fat and 10% water and fits \
both t2 values, \"2compF\" assumes 90% fat and 10% water with a water t2 of \
20 ms.\nThese are method A, B and C of Keene KR et.al. DOI: 10.1002/mrm.28290."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"4f1cb71a-29c4-2e49-8c69-566d3751100b"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "7933ef14-58c3-6e41-abdb-c082f1224567"], 
    ButtonBox["EPGRefocussingPhase",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsRelaxometryTools/ref/EPGRefocussingPhase"], 
    "0.", Cell[TextData[{
     "EPGRefocussingPhase is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "b5dd2ae4-ad77-e54e-b793-4cbab61f74d5"],
     " and ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["CreateT2Dictionary",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/CreateT2Dictionary"]], 
      "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"4b93844b-8eb1-1548-8141-2060a788f238"],
     ". It specifies the phase of the refocussing pulse."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"b6bd4135-1c92-374b-a4e1-fed16e538166"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "9fc9885e-ee60-3f40-bc23-00f4f181673a"], 
    ButtonBox["EPGRepetitionTime",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRIToolsRelaxometryTools/ref/EPGRepetitionTime"], 
    "0.", Cell[TextData[{
     "EPGRepetitionTime is an option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "1aebfcd3-cdea-534a-becc-9afc0539ba20"],
     " and Calibrate",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "EPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
      "0eb05743-d753-aa45-a868-8cc6015fa091"],
     ". If larger than 0 it is the repetition time in ms and the water and \
fat signals are corrected for incomplete T1 recovery between repetitions, \
using the T1 values of EPGRelaxPars.\nThe water signal fraction of adipose \
tissue in the fat model is then also reduced such that it is 10% water after \
the correction."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"e378317c-8eea-184f-b9a2-c65b00de021d"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->291544802,ExpressionUUID->"971e3471-5b8b-314b-95ba-55549c8966fb"]
}, Open  ]],

